{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05837","headline":"赠房卢氏琯 · 王维","name":"赠房卢氏琯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"达人无不可，忘己爱苍生。\n岂复少十室，弦歌在两楹。\n浮人日已归，但坐事农耕。\n桑榆郁相望，邑里多鸡鸣。\n秋山一何净，苍翠临寒城。\n视事兼偃卧，对书不簪缨。\n萧条人吏疎，鸟雀下空庭。\n鄙夫心所尚，晚节异平生。\n将从海岳居，守静解天刑。\n或可累安邑，茅茨君试营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}